# `rtok agents send` / `rtok agents inbox` (T287): the deterministic refusals. Sending,
# reading, `--all-live` and the ended-agent refusal need registered agents (fresh UUIDs and
# timestamps per run) and are covered by `tests/agents_messages.rs` instead.

```console
$ HOME=target/tmp/t287-msg RTOK_HOME=target/tmp/t287-msg rtok agents inbox
? 1
Error: not inside an agent session; pass an agent id

$ HOME=target/tmp/t287-msg RTOK_HOME=target/tmp/t287-msg rtok agents send ffff hi
? 1
Error: agent ffff: unknown

$ HOME=target/tmp/t287-msg RTOK_HOME=target/tmp/t287-msg rtok agents send --all-live
? 1
Error: usage: rtok agents send <id-prefix> <text|->, or --all-live <text|->

```
